- **The withdrawal drill.** Remove one scaffolding item; run the model on the failure case it was built for, with and without. The merged text must show the decision was made against the comparison you set, and must not contain a number you did not give.
- **The permanence trace.** Take one failure record and follow it to either an applied fix or a proposed fix. The result must match your answer to question 2; if it does not, part 3 is ambiguous.

